# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in. `.env.local` is gitignored; never commit a key.

# Base URL of the Django API.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000

# Proxy target for the dev server (defaults to http://localhost:8000).
# Must match what vite.config.ts reads: VITE_API_PROXY_TARGET.
# VITE_API_PROXY_TARGET=http://localhost:8000

# Brandfetch Logo API client ID -- https://developers.brandfetch.com/register
# Optional. With it unset, no bank logos are requested and the UI shows its own
# initial avatars. The value is embedded in <img src> by design (Brandfetch's
# docs tell you to embed it), so it is not a server secret -- but it has a
# monthly request allowance, so keep it out of version control.
# VITE_BRANDFETCH_CLIENT_ID=

# Reminder: every VITE_* value is compiled into the public JS bundle and is
# readable by anyone. Never put a server secret (SECRET_KEY, DB or AI API keys)
# here. See "Frontend-exposed configuration" in SECURITY.md.
